{'symbol': 'ABC', 'date': '2023-01-24 07:00:00', 'title': 'AMERISOURCEBERGEN ANNOUNCES INTENT TO CHANGE NAME TO CENCORA', 'text': "CONSHOHOCKEN, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERISOURCEBERGEN (NYSE: ABC) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INTENT TO CHANGE ITS NAME TO BETTER REFLECT ITS BOLD VISION AND PURPOSE-DRIVEN APPROACH TO CREATING HEALTHIER FUTURES. AMERISOURCEBERGEN INTENDS TO BECOME CENCORA. THE NEW NAME REPRESENTS A UNIFIED PRESENCE THAT WILL CONTINUE TO FUEL THE COMPANY'S ONGOING GROWTH STRATEGY AND ADVANCE ITS IMPACT ACROSS HEALTHCARE."}